      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my little boy has a fever and some weird red spots all over his stomach and legs. they look like tiny little purple dots. i tried pressing a clear glass against them to see if they go away but they dont, they like stay red through the glass. is this just a heat rash or maybe something from a virus? i dont want to panic if it's nothing",
